As a child matures,

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:40.320
the amount of eumelanin in the hair tends to increase,

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.280
darkening the color.

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:42.640
In some extreme cases,

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:44.800
it can even take a child with platinum blonde hair

