00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.440
Some other symptoms of HPP in infants

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.040
can include restricted movement,

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.000
an altered gait,

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.280
