All of which we see in JJ's enlarged head

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.760
and awkwardly stiff animation

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:19.520
from JJ throughout the series.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.360
HPP is a serious disease,

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:23.280
which can cause a lot of recurring fractures

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:25.440
in places like your feet or your thigh bones.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:27.040
It can also lead to chronic inflammation

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.320
and joint pain later in life.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.520
In the worst of cases,

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:30.720
it can even be fatal.

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.480
It's also an inherited disease.

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:34.000
So just like the hair and eye color,

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.760
JJ would have gotten the genes necessary

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:37.600
for his diseases from his parents.

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:40.080
This is the true dark secret of Cocomelon.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.560
Underneath this happy family facade of nursery rhymes

